WEBVTT

00:11:28.392 --> 00:11:30.144
try to call a friend,

00:11:30.185 --> 00:11:32.312
go online or try to get
in a support group.

00:11:33.772 --> 00:11:38.944
If you're a woman who's not transgender
but you know pain of isolation,

00:11:38.986 --> 00:11:40.612
of sexual assault --

00:11:40.612 --> 00:11:41.822
reach out.

00:11:44.825 --> 00:11:47.578
So what does it mean to be a woman?

00:11:48.746 --> 00:11:50.539
The latest research is showing

00:11:50.539 --> 00:11:54.668
that female and male brains
do develop differently in the womb,

00:11:54.668 --> 00:11:58.422
possibly giving us females
this innate sense of being a woman.

00:11:59.423 --> 00:12:00.716
On the other hand,